  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In an April 21, 2026 press briefing, Hurst said generative AI is a \"game changer\" for reconciling data and could change how the department approaches its audit. At the same briefing, he listed AI and data infrastructure among investments in a presidential priorities category in the budget. In a 2021 bylined article, Hurst wrote that AI/ML technologies offer defense leaders tools for longstanding problems but are not solutions in themselves.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "In an April 21, 2026 press briefing, Hurst said generative AI is a \"game changer\" for reconciling data and could change how the department approaches its audit.",
     "sids": [
